---
const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Head from "../../components/Head.astro";
import Logo from "../../images/Krystal.svg"

---

<BaseLayout renderHome={true}>
    <Head slot="head"
        title="Krystal - Test++"
        description="Test++ is a C++ unit testing framework and CLI tool meant to help C++ 
            developers streamline testing their C++ code. Learn more about the latest version
            of Test++, how to install it, and how to use it here."
        keywords="test++, testpp, testplusplus, test plus plus, krystal test++, krystal testplusplus,
            krystal test plus plus, c++ unit testing framework, cpp unit testing framework, c++ unit test
            cpp unit test"
    />

    <main>
        <section>
            <h1>Test++</h1>
            <img id="logo" src={Logo.src} alt="Placeholder for Test++'s logo"/>

            <div id="status-bar">
                <p>Status: Release</p>
                <p id="middle">Version: 20.1.3</p>
                <p>License: MIT</p>
            </div>
            
            <p>
                Test++ is a header-only C++ unit testing library and framework. It is 
                available for download and installation on MacOS, Windows, and Linux. That
                being said, its development was largely done on MacOS, and as such, its 
                usage on Windows and Linux systems is largely untested. It is currently 
                built using C++20. Using Test++ with other C++ standards is largely untested.
            </p>
        </section>

        <article>
            <section>

            </section>
        </article>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>

section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;

    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 25px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);

    margin: 2.5%;
    width: 95%;
    height: fit-content;
    background: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 5svh;
}

p {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 80%;
}

#logo {
   filter: var(--logo-filter);
}

#status-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto auto auto;

    width: 90%;
    margin: 5% 5% 5% 5%;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
}

#status-bar p {
    align-self: center;
    margin: 0;
}

#middle {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
    border-right: 3px solid var(--card-border-color);
}
</style>